"3,0": {
"v": "\nWorkflow: 1. RNA Fragmentation + Priming; 2. First strand cDNA synthesis; 3. Second strand cDNA synthesis + Poly A; 4. Adapter Ligation; 5. SPRI clean-up + size selection; 6. Barcoding PCR; 7. SPRI clean-up + size selection. \n\nThese protocols are an adaptation of the Watchmaker RNA Library Prep Kit Protocol. \n"
},
"4,0": {
"v": "General Notes:\n  * Keep all samples, buffers, and enzymes on ice unless noted\n  * Thaw all buffers on ice, then invert, vortex >5s, and spin down\n  * Enzymes and Equinox should be on ice before use; invert 10x\n  * Vortex (or pipette >10x) + spin down all master mixes\n  * Always centrifuge all tubes prior to opening\n  * Calculations in this worksheet include a 10% overage for pipetting variation\n"
},
