"16,0": {
"v": "\n*FastSelect is designed for removing human rRNA, omit this reagent if not using human derived samples and only incubate at 85\u00b0C and then directly to 4\u00b0C (omit ramping down steps).\n\n** Fragmentation is optional and dependent on input RNA quality. Refer to manufacturer protocol for guidelines. For low input or low quality samples, we recommend ommitting.\n\nMix the master mix and final rxns by pipetting up and down.\n\nThermocycler (heated lid set to 105\u02daC):\n\u00b7      Pre-heat hold at 85\u00b0C\n\u00b7      (0-5 min at 85\u00b0C)**\n\u00b7       2 min 75C\n\u00b7       2 min 70C\n\u00b7       2 min 65C\n\u00b7       2 min 60C\n\u00b7       2 min 55C\n\u00b7       5 min 37C\n\u00b7       5 min 25C\n\u00b7       Hold 4\u00b0C\n"
},
